	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">U.N. Security Council Remains Divided After Powell's Call for Quick Action on Iraq</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/2_ds_73516.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/UN_IRAQ189.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">The U.S. case against Saddam Hussein is entering a critical 10-day period in which top inspectors will visit Baghdad and make a key report to the U.N. Security Council. Their comments could help decide whether there will be war in Iraq.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/2_ds_73516.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
