	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">NASA Backs Away From Theory That Foam Was the 'Root Cause' of the Columbia Disaster</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/2_ds_72027.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SHUTTLE_INVESTIGATIO53.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">After days of analysis, NASA backed away Wednesday from the theory that a piece of foam that struck Columbia during liftoff was the root cause of the space shuttle's disintegration over Texas.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/2_ds_72027.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
