	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">North Korea Says It Has Reactivated Nuclear Facilities to Produce Electricity</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/2_ds_73479.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SOUTH_KOREA_KOREAS_N54.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">North Korea said Wednesday it has reactivated its nuclear facilities, an announcement that raised questions whether it was trying to take advantage of Washington's preoccupation with Iraq to ratchet up pressure in its own standoff with the United States.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/2_ds_73479.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
