	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">World Court Rules That U.S. Must Stay the Execution of Three Mexicans on Death Row</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/2_ds_72009.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/WORLD_COURT_DEATH_PE.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">The United States must temporarily stay the execution of three Mexican citizens on death row in Texas and Oklahoma, the World Court ruled Wednesday.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/2_ds_72009.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
