		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/2_ds_73213.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/WALL_STREET39.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Wall Street waffled and then fell for a second straight day Wednesday as investors grew increasingly nervous about a war with Iraq following Secretary of State Colin Powell's address to the United Nations.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/2_ds_73213.asp">Full Story</a>
